 "takeaways": [
  "**Max = a + |b|, Min = a − |b|.** Same as sine: c and d only move or squeeze the wave.",
  "**Period = 2π ÷ c.**",
  "Cos and sin are the same wave slid by a quarter turn: cos θ = sin(θ + π/2)."
 ],
